    "text": "An Act to repeal the Presidents\u2019 Entitlements Act, No. 4 of 1986",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      139.93,
      326.51,
      167.2
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      181.17,
      324.02,
      208.6
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Presidents\u2019 Entitlements(Repeal) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      222.57,
      326.5,
      263.8
    ],
    "text": "2. The Presidents\u2019 Entitlements Act, No. 4 of 1986(hereinafter referred to as the \u201crepealed Act\u201d) is hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      96.0,
      275.97,
      324.0,
      289.81
    ],
    "text": "3. For the avoidance of doubt, it is hereby declared that-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.34,
      302.93,
      324.01,
      355.4
    ],
    "text": "(a) any residence provided to, or monthly allowancepaid to, a former President or the widow of aformer President in terms of the provisions ofsection 2 of the repealed Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.34,
      367.93,
      324.01,
      433.4
    ],
    "text": "(b) monthly secretarial allowance paid to, andofficial transport and such other facilitiesprovided to, a former President or the widow ofa former President in terms of the provisions ofsection 3 of the repealed Act; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.9,
      445.93,
      324.01,
      485.4
    ],
    "text": "(c) monthly pension paid to the widow of a formerPresident in terms of the provisions of section 4of the repealed Act,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      497.73,
      326.51,
      539.0
    ],
    "text": "preceding the date of commencement of this Act, shall no longer be provided with or paid to, on and after the date of commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      60.0,
      38.53,
      252.76,
      52.01
    ],
    "text": "2Presidents\u2019 Entitlements (Repeal)",
    "fonts": [
